   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Winter Response - Aarsal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With over 140 refugee camps in Aarsal, many refugees are no longer able to afford the necessary items needed to keep themselves and their families warm. Through this project, URDA aims to provide assistance to refugees living in informal settlements with little to no shelter to help them make it through this winter season.</narrative>
